# Raw exports from the portal contain the real tenant name and IP addresses.
# Keep them out of the repo; commit only sanitised copies under sample-data/.
query_data*.csv
incident_cases*.csv
*-raw.csv
raw/

# Power BI: the exported M query embeds the workspace ID, and a .pbix built
# on live data embeds real sign-in records. Commit only a sample-data build,
# named *-sample.pbix.
PowerBIQuery*.txt
*.pbix
!*-sample.pbix

